# Netlify's rules for plotdevice.app (Milestone 24). English is the default, at the root; a first visit
# from a Hebrew-language browser is sent to /he/ by the page itself (src/components/Head.astro), so a
# reader's own choice of language always wins.

# The guide has no front page of its own: it starts at installing. A redirect on the server, so the
# browser goes straight there without a page in between. (The site's own links go there directly.)
/docs     /docs/start/install/     301
/he/docs  /he/docs/start/install/  301

# A missing Hebrew page answers with the Hebrew not-found page; anything else gets /404.html.
/he/*  /he/404/  404
